马七进六 { [%emt 0:09:08] [%think 54726] [%out 55441] [%in 4] [%cacheread 0]
[%cachewrite 3683] [%illegal 1] Red's h2 cannon cannot shift to the center
because the g2 horse blocks the rank. **Analysis:** - **Why this move:** The c2
horse can jump to d4, since its leg square c3 is empty. From d4 it sits in the
center and attacks black's e6 pawn. - **e6 is undefended:** No black piece can
recapture on that square, so red threatens 马六进五 to win a pawn. - **Opens
the c-file:** Once the horse leaves c2, the cannon can play 炮八平七 next. The
black elephant on c5 would act as the screen for capturing the c9 elephant, and
that capture gives check. - **d4 is safe:** Black's elephant, cannons and
horses cannot reach d4 right now. - **Checked black's replies:** - The b7
cannon going to b3 can be taken by the horse. - Cannon to c7 and then capturing
the c0 elephant with check is met by the a0 chariot recapturing. - The h7
cannon capturing e3 is met by the g2 horse recapturing. None of these costs red
material. - **Rejected alternative:** 马七进八 would put the horse on b4 as a
screen. Black's cannon could then take red's b2 cannon, so I ruled it out. }
